            "title": "Leverage Next-Gen Compression",
            "content": "AVIF offers 30-50% better compression than WebP and 50-70% better than JPEG. Use quality 75-85 for web images—AVIF maintains excellent quality at lower settings due to advanced perceptual optimization. For high-end photography or HDR content, use quality 85-95 to fully utilize AVIF's 10-bit and 12-bit color depth capabilities."
